    "description": "<p>HEALER</p>\n<p>Your magic reaches beyond normal limits, revitalising even those at death's door.<br>If you magically heal a creature that has the Dying condition, it regains half the normal amount of HP restored by the spell rather than being restored to 1 HP.<br>This feat may restore HP, but it does not remove injuries or reverse death through old age.</p>\n<p>Prerequisites Medicine 6 ranks</p>\n<p>Works automatically: a Dying creature you heal magically regains half the spell's healing (and the Dying step as normal).</p>",
